  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU support to access to essential primary health care services in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective/Impact of this action is to strengthen Lebanon&#xbf;s health systems to improve Universal Health Coverage (UHC).The Specific Objectives (Outcomes) of this action are to 1.Access to equitable, affordable and quality PHC is improved2.Access to health commodities including vaccinations and essential medicines is strengthened</narrative>
  </description>
